    {
      "sort_order": 1,
      "title_en": "A Day at the Farm",
      "body_en": "Ollie and Nong Fah went to the farm.\n\nFirst they saw a big brown cow. It was eating grass. \"Moo!\" said the cow.\n\nNext they saw three small white sheep. Their wool was soft.\n\nA grey cat slept in the sun. It did not move at all.\n\nIn the pond, six yellow ducks were swimming. They were very noisy.\n\nA red hen walked past with her chicks. Nong Fah counted eight chicks.\n\n\"The cow is the biggest animal here,\" said Nong Fah. \"And the chicks are the smallest.\"\n\n\"Every animal is different,\" said Ollie. \"That is what makes the farm wonderful.\""
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 2,
      "title_en": "A Tour of My House",
      "body_en": "Nong Fah gave Emily a tour of her house.\n\n\"This is the kitchen. We cook and eat here. There is a table and four chairs.\"\n\n\"This is the living room. There is a sofa and a television. We sit here in the evening.\"\n\n\"This is my bedroom. My bed is by the window. My books are on the shelf.\"\n\n\"This is the bathroom. I brush my teeth here every morning and every night.\"\n\n\"And this is the garden. My grandmother grows flowers here. There are red and yellow flowers.\"\n\n\"Your house is lovely!\" said Emily."
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 3,
      "title_en": "When I Grow Up",
      "body_en": "\"What do you want to be when you grow up?\" Ollie asked.\n\n\"I want to be a doctor,\" said Nong Fah. \"Doctors work in a hospital. They help sick people.\"\n\n\"I want to be a teacher,\" said Emily. \"Teachers work in a school. They help children learn.\"\n\n\"I want to be a farmer,\" said Thawan. \"Farmers work on a farm. They grow food.\"\n\n\"And I am already a teacher,\" said Ollie. \"I teach you English every day!\"\n\nEverybody laughed."
    }
  ],
